 # --- Source Files ---
 # Sistem auto-detect mendeteksi semua file .cpp, .c, .cc.
+# Termasuk EAGLE graphics engine di graphics/ (GraphicsEngine.cpp, ShadowManager.cpp,
+# graphics/Math/Matrix4.cpp, ...). Engine hanya butuh GLESv3 + EGL + shadowhook (sudah ada).
